Z||000003||overlord||06-05-2001||05:15 PM||||howd i do that?<BR>well lets see.....sanding, sanding,   sanding, sanding........o did i mention the sanding?<P>-first i stipped old paint off<BR>-sanded with 220 grit<BR>-sanded with 400<BR>-sanded with 600<BR>-sanded with 800<BR>-sanded with 1500<BR>-spray painted inside spokes with chrome paint<BR>-then polish with chrome/mag alum polish.<P>Took forever and a lot of skin   but worth the effort.||||reg||1
